  "body": "Motivation has increased and now is the time to secure this terrific property for future!\r\n\r\nCrafted for longevity and designed for impact, this architectural home is constructed primarily in rendered brick and features steel framing. Thanks to recent renovations, every corner of the property reflects meticulous care, anchored by sleek, contemporary bathrooms finished to an exceptional standard.\r\n\r\nThe floorplan is thoughtfully arranged to accommodate both family life and sophisticated hosting, featuring four well-appointed bedrooms (including a master with ensuite), two living areas, and a double garage with internal access. With the recent addition of HRV ensures year-round dryness and comfort.\r\n\r\nThe interior is defined by a sense of openness, where floor-to-ceiling windows invite a flow of natural light and perfectly frame the surrounding landscape. Positioned to capture the northern sun, the home looks out across the golf course toward the sea. These views are enjoyed from an impressive outdoor living space, equipped with adjustable louvers and integrated lighting to ensure the area remains a functional sanctuary regardless of the season.\r\n\r\nThe approximately 627sqm freehold section strikes a practical balance, offering generous space for gardens or play while remaining manageable for those who value a low-maintenance lifestyle. Tucked away in a quiet street, the property sits moments from the local marina, vibrant marine village, and nearby beaches. Best of all, top-tier schooling (including Wentworth) and the city ferry terminal are within comfortable walking distance.",
